{"InfinispanIdentityProviderStorageProvider.remove() dereferences storedIdp via registerIDPInvalidation/registerIDPLoginInvalidation even when idpDelegate.getByAlias(alias) returns null, causing an NPE instead of returning false for non-existent aliases": 0.8492168188095093, "The getForLogin cached path resolves IDP IDs via session.identityProviders().getById(id) which applies createOrganizationAwareIdentityProviderModel wrapping that can override isEnabled() to return false, but the resolved models are returned without re-filtering against the login predicate, so IDPs that no longer qualify for login can be served from cache": 0.8538678884506226, "idpDelegate.getByAlias(alias) is now called unconditionally before the isInvalid check in remove(), adding a database round-trip even when the cache is valid and cached.getIdentityProvider() already holds the needed IDP model for registerIDPLoginInvalidation": 0.7595740556716919}